                    "text": "I've got other things to do right now..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "695760302",
                    "speaker": "Rosaria",
                    "text": "Heading out? I think I'll stick around for a while. Pretty sure there's nothing but errands waiting for me back at the Cathedral..."
